[{"text":"ex = PaVe[1, {p10, p12, p20}, {m1^2, m2^2, m3^2}, PaVeAutoOrder -> False]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_1\\left(\\text{p10},\\text{p12},\\text{p20},\\text{m1}^2,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[ex, PaVeOrderList -> {m2, m1, m3}]","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_1\\left(\\text{p10},\\text{p12},\\text{p20},\\text{m1}^2,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)","anchor":"cb12-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"In fact, such a rewriting is possible, but it involves a linear relation between multiple PaVe functions. To avoid an accidental expression swell, by default PaVeOrder uses only 1-to-1 relations. Setting the option Sum to True allows the routine to return linear relations too","anchor":"cb12-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[ex, PaVeOrderList -> {m2, m1, m3}, Sum -> True]","anchor":"cb13","section":"Examples"},{"text":"-\\text{C}_0\\left(\\text{p10},\\text{p20},\\text{p12},\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m1}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)-\\text{C}_1\\left(\\text{p10},\\text{p20},\\text{p12},\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m1}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)-\\text{C}_2\\left(\\text{p10},\\text{p20},\\text{p12},\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m1}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)","anchor":"cb13-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"When trying to minimize the number of PaVe functions in the expression, one often has to try different orderings first","anchor":"cb13-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"diff = (C0[0, SP[p, p], SP[p, p], 0, 0, 0] + 2 PaVe[1, {0, SP[p, p], SP[p, p]}, {0, 0, 0}] + PaVe[1, {SP[p, p], SP[p, p], 0}, {0, 0, 0}])","anchor":"cb14","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_0\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)+2 \\;\\text{C}_1\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)+\\text{C}_1\\left(\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0,0\\right)","anchor":"cb14-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"This ordering doesn’t look very helpful","anchor":"cb14-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[diff, PaVeOrderList -> {0, SP[p, p], SP[p, p]}, Sum -> True] % // PaVeOrder","anchor":"cb15","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_0\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)+2 \\;\\text{C}_1\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)+\\text{C}_2\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)","anchor":"cb15-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_0\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)+2 \\;\\text{C}_1\\left(0,\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)+\\text{C}_1\\left(\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0,0\\right)","anchor":"cb15-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"But this one does the job","anchor":"cb15-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[diff, PaVeOrderList -> {SP[p, p], 0, SP[p, p]}, Sum -> True] % // PaVeOrder","anchor":"cb16","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_1\\left(\\overline{p}^2,0,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)-\\text{C}_2\\left(\\overline{p}^2,0,\\overline{p}^2,0,0,0\\right)","anchor":"cb16-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[0\\]","anchor":"cb16-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Here are few simpler cases","anchor":"cb16-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"diff = PaVe[0, {0}, {m2^2, m3^2}] + PaVe[1, {0}, {m3^2, m2^2}] + PaVe[1, {0}, {m2^2, m3^2}]","anchor":"cb17","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{B}_0\\left(0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)+\\text{B}_1\\left(0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)+\\text{B}_1\\left(0,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m2}^2\\right)","anchor":"cb17-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[diff, PaVeOrderList -> {m2, m3}, Sum -> True]","anchor":"cb18","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[0\\]","anchor":"cb18-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"diff = PaVe[0, {0}, {m2^2, m3^2}] + 2 PaVe[1, {0}, {m3^2, m2^2}] - PaVe[1, 1, {0}, {m2^2, m3^2}] + PaVe[1, 1, {0}, {m3^2, m2^2}]","anchor":"cb19","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{B}_0\\left(0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)+2 \\;\\text{B}_1\\left(0,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m2}^2\\right)-\\text{B}_{11}\\left(0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)+\\text{B}_{11}\\left(0,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m2}^2\\right)","anchor":"cb19-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[diff, Sum -> True, PaVeOrderList -> {m3, m2}]","anchor":"cb20","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[0\\]","anchor":"cb20-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"diff = PaVe[0, {0, 0, 0}, {m2^2, m3^2, m4^2}] + 2 PaVe[1, {0, 0, 0}, {m2^2, m3^2, m4^2}] + 2 PaVe[1, {0, 0, 0}, {m3^2, m2^2, m4^2}] + PaVe[1, 1, {0, 0, 0}, {m2^2, m3^2, m4^2}] - PaVe[1, 1, {0, 0, 0}, {m2^2, m4^2, m3^2}] + PaVe[1, 1, {0, 0, 0}, {m3^2, m2^2, m4^2}] + 2 PaVe[1, 2, {0, 0, 0}, {m4^2, m2^2, m3^2}]","anchor":"cb21","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_0\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m4}^2\\right)+2 \\;\\text{C}_1\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m4}^2\\right)+2 \\;\\text{C}_1\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m4}^2\\right)+\\text{C}_{11}\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m4}^2\\right)-\\text{C}_{11}\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m4}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)+\\text{C}_{11}\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m3}^2,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m4}^2\\right)+2 \\;\\text{C}_{12}\\left(0,0,0,\\text{m4}^2,\\text{m2}^2,\\text{m3}^2\\right)","anchor":"cb21-4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVeOrder[diff, Sum -> True, PaVeOrderList -> {m3, m2}]","anchor":"cb22","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[0\\]","anchor":"cb22-1","section":"Examples"}]